===Level 87/88-98: Adamant platebodies===
{{plinkp|Adamant platebody}} Smith [[adamant platebodies]] from levels 88 to 98 for 312.5 experience each. Alternatively, from level 87 Smithing players can also boost to 88 for adamant platebodies with [[dwarven stout]]. Adamant platebodies give up to 250,000 experience per hour with the use of [[Energy potion(4)|energy potions]]. Smithing [[adamant platebodies]] from levels 87/88 to 98/99 may take upwards of 35-45 hours depending on efficiency and use of [[Energy potion(4)|energy potions]].

Note: The next section for [[rune platebodies]] is helpful and slightly faster experience per hour. However, most players will opt to continue smithing [[adamant platebodies]] all the way to level 99 even though [[rune platebodies]] are more experience per item, as adamant platebodies may be cheaper experience per gold spent for comparable XP rates.

